WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.740
than historical IgE therapies, given the ability to target IgE in a fundamentally different way.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:12.560
In the case of Murex, a novel payload that hopefully has the NMTI payload that has a cleaner

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.600
profile than the toposomerase payloads. But I think you have to have some sort of differentiated

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:22.880
conviction just given that the price levels are climbing. You know, that said, you have to be able

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:28.560
to access external innovation to grow companies of our size. So, we have to just keep looking for

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:35.120
that right balance of breakthrough science and then finding the right balance from a valuation

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:35.680
standpoint.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:41.360
Your point on Palo-Carson is well taken. I mean, there is, you know, an element here of the

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:47.760
MACE endpoint versus, you know, CV death. Lp is associated with high rates of sudden cardiac death,

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:53.440
particularly in younger patients. Very difficult, of course, for us to say without having,

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:59.120
you know, locked the database and seen the data to know exactly. But there is at least the

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:05.680
potential for CV death to be an important component, at least theoretically, given the profile of Lp

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:14.480
and something we'll have to look carefully at and how that drives versus other elements of the endpoint.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:18.270
Next question.

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:25.310
Thank you. Your next question comes from the line of Kerry Holford from Barenberg. Please go ahead.

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:34.510
Thank you very much. Question for me on Kitsukale, just on the IP. The extension that you've been

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:36.750
granted related to pediatric.

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:46.750
Can you confirm now that that complimentary expiry is May 2032, and in the context of your earlier

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:52.350
settlements of generic players, is that when we should now be assuming generic market?

00:01:52.350 --> 00:02:06.780
Thanks for the question. So our guidance is second half 2031. So Q3 2031 guidance for LOE for

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:09.340
Kitsukale with the pediatric service.

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:16.060
pediatric exclusivity. And that's inclusive of the settlements that we have with generic

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:23.440
manufacturers. Thank you. And just as a quick note as well, we double checked. In China for

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:30.660
Cosimta, we have 70% market share and our market leader as well. Next question, Alfred.

